# Shared by every HORUS SITL profile (see sim/scripts/world_profiles.py for the compositions).
# No fragment sets a key another fragment of the same load order sets; only alternatives for one
# slot (indoor|outdoor, canonical_fence|procedural_fence) set the same keys, to different values.

# MAVLink-backed horizontal proximity sectors: the ToF bridge sends DISTANCE_SENSOR, and
# ArduPilot's simple avoidance brakes before obstacles instead of flying through them.
PRX1_TYPE 2
AVOID_ENABLE 3
# Stop 1 m from proximity obstacles (default 2 m): indoors the executor's 1.2 m wall-centre
# geofence inset (0.1 m half wall + 1 m + 0.1 m slack) stays reachable instead of fighting
# avoidance at the edge; outdoors the executor's clearance margins (orbit 1.5 m, scan 2 m) do.
AVOID_MARGIN 1.0

# Downward ToF (payload range_down, 4 m range) from DISTANCE_SENSOR orientation PITCH_270 as a
# short-range landing/altitude input.
RNGFND1_TYPE 10
RNGFND1_ORIENT 25
# Copter 4.7 MIN/MAX are in metres; the old centimetre-named parameters no longer exist.
RNGFND1_MIN 0.05
RNGFND1_MAX 4.0

# Gimbal (iris_with_gimbal): servo 9/10/11 drive roll/pitch/yaw (mount servo functions roll=8,
# tilt=7, pan=6). The model maps the pitch servo's 1100-1900 us range to +135..-45 deg, so
# MNT1_PITCH_MIN/MAX must be -135/45 (upstream gazebo-iris-gimbal.parm) for a -90 deg command to
# point the camera straight down.
MNT1_TYPE 1
MNT1_PITCH_MIN -135
MNT1_PITCH_MAX 45
MNT1_YAW_MIN -160
MNT1_YAW_MAX 160
SERVO9_FUNCTION 8
SERVO10_FUNCTION 7
SERVO11_FUNCTION 6
